<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Vizag To Bangalore Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are mandatory for a house shifting from Vizag to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To move a household from Vizag to Bangalore you will need a valid government‑issued ID (Aadhaar or PAN), the original rental or ownership agreement of the source and destination premises, a GST‑registered invoice from the packers and movers, and an e‑Way bill for goods exceeding INR 50,000. If the move is corporate‑backed, include the internal relocation request and cost‑center approval. All documents should be scanned and shared with the mover before loading begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the 7‑layer protective packaging system applied to fragile items during the Vizag‑Bangalore transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with an 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap that cushions each item, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors to absorb shocks. Next, multi‑ply corrugated sheets are wrapped around the object, then a stretch film provides weather‑proof sealing. Custom wooden crates are built for glass, temple idols, or delicate electronics, and finally a layer of IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers any loss. This sequence ensures items survive the 850 km highway journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Vizag to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers equips every container truck with a satellite‑enabled GPS unit that streams real‑time location data to a secure dashboard. Customers receive a unique tracking ID via SMS and email, allowing them to monitor progress at each major waypoint—Raipur, Nagpur, and Hyderabad—until the cargo reaches the Bangalore destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical cost factors influencing the price for relocating a 2‑BHK home from Vizag to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by the total volume (cubic feet) of household goods, distance‑based fuel surcharge, type of vehicle required (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft container), any special handling for fragile or high‑value items, insurance coverage level, and additional services such as packing, unpacking, or temporary storage. Seasonal demand and toll taxes on NH 44 can also affect the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the IBA approval benefit customers hiring packers and movers for Vizag‑to‑Bangalore relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The Indian Banks Association (IBA) code ensures that movers adhere to strict financial and operational standards, including transparent billing, verified insurance, and grievance redressal mechanisms. For customers, this means reduced risk of hidden charges, guaranteed claim settlement for any loss, and a reliable partner vetted by a nationally recognized body.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any toll or state tax considerations when moving goods from Vizag to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The route traverses Andhra Pradesh, Telangana, and Karnataka, each with its own toll plazas on NH 44 and NH 33. Movers typically include toll estimates in the cost matrix, but customers should be aware of possible state‑specific GST on transportation services. Shree Ashirwad provides a detailed toll breakdown and can arrange for electronic toll collection (ETC) to streamline the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken for transporting two‑wheelers on the Vizag‑to‑Bangalore corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheelers are loaded onto dedicated carriers equipped with hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Each bike is inspected, fuel tank emptied to 10 % capacity, and covered with a weather‑proof tarp. The carrier’s GPS tracking and live CCTV monitoring ensure continuous oversight, while the driver follows a pre‑planned route to avoid high‑traffic zones.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
